  <Row><Cell>ui_mercenary_custom_godwin</Cell><Cell>Father Godwin (2500 groschen).</Cell><Cell>Padre Godwin (2500 groschen).</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>merc_henry_godwin</Cell><Cell>Father Godwin. Get him.</Cell><Cell>El Padre Godwin. Consíguelo.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>merc_provider_godwin</Cell><Cell>From priest to mercenary... what a man.</Cell><Cell>De sacerdote a mercenario... qué hombre.</Cell></Row>

